sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant R as React App
    participant F as FastAPI
    participant A as AuthService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    U->>R: Email + password
    R->>F: POST /api/auth/login
    F->>A: authenticate(email, password)
    A->>DB: SELECT user WHERE email = ?
    DB-->>A: User record
    A->>A: bcrypt.checkpw(password, hash)

    alt Valid credentials
        A->>A: check role == PASSENGER
        A-->>F: AuthenticationResult
        F->>F: create_access_token(user_id, role)
        F-->>R: 200 {access_token, user}
        R->>R: localStorage.setItem('token', ...)
        R-->>U: Redirect to dashboard
    else Invalid credentials
        A-->>F: raise AuthenticationError
        F-->>R: 401 {detail: "Invalid credentials"}
        R-->>U: Show error
    end

    Note over R,F: All subsequent requests:<br/>Authorization: Bearer <token>

    R->>F: GET /api/bookings/my (with token)
    F->>F: decode_access_token()
    F->>DB: SELECT user WHERE id = ?
    DB-->>F: User
    F->>F: require_passenger_profile()
    F-->>R: 200 {bookings}